# rule.always.externalize.tactics.into_skills

## 🔴 this is the PARENT — go to a specialization

| you are about to | reach for |
|---|---|
| write a repeated **sequence** down as a runnable artifact | `rule.always.enskill-the-tactics-you-discover` — DISCOVER |
| notice a skill you called and **still finished by hand** | `rule.always.entool-the-skills-you-touch` — UPGRADE |
| lay a sequence of **judgments** rather than commands | 🗿 a **route**, per the enskill rule |

⇒ **a loop, never alternatives:** discover a repeat → ENSKILL → notice the leftover brain work → ENTOOL.

## the general claim it still carries

when an action takes multiple steps, encode it as a skill — **idempotent**, safe to run twice, in `.agent/repo=.this/role=*/skills/`. do NOT wait.

cues: multiple steps · hard to discover · you chained commands · you will do it again.
test: **"would i want a button for this?"**

blocker: a tactic repeated and not externalized.
